WEBVTT

00:04.879 --> 00:06.673
Next question, Kuze.

00:09.801 --> 00:10.635
Yes.

00:10.719 --> 00:11.553
JAMONICA WORKBOOK

00:11.636 --> 00:12.887
It's 6.6-pi.

00:13.471 --> 00:16.224
It's 6.6.

00:16.307 --> 00:17.809
Correct.

00:20.228 --> 00:21.938
She speaks so softly.

00:22.021 --> 00:24.107
I have no idea what she's saying.

00:28.319 --> 00:30.947
<i>Marina didn't do anything-pi.</i>

00:31.990 --> 00:33.450
NO TRESPASSING

00:33.533 --> 00:37.245
<i>This might be the first step
to making up-pi.</i>

00:55.597 --> 00:58.975
TAKOPI'S ORIGINAL SIN

01:52.529 --> 01:53.780
EPISODE 2: TAKOPI'S SALVATION

01:53.863 --> 01:58.118
It's been a while
since I took a walk with someone.

01:58.201 --> 01:59.661
Really-pi?

02:03.331 --> 02:07.043
I used to take walks
with my dad all the time.

02:07.127 --> 02:08.461
Do you have a papa-pi?

02:09.212 --> 02:10.255
I do.

02:10.922 --> 02:13.633
But he left home when I was little.

02:13.716 --> 02:16.761
<i>- I guess that happens to humans too.</i>
- Pi!

02:19.389 --> 02:22.016
The night my dad left,

02:22.684 --> 02:24.936
the sky was full of stars just like now.

02:25.854 --> 02:29.357
I wished upon the stars with all my heart

02:30.692 --> 02:35.530
that my parents wouldn't get divorced.

02:37.240 --> 02:39.117
But it didn't come true.

02:40.160 --> 02:42.287
At that time, I thought,

02:43.163 --> 02:44.956
"Magic doesn't exist.

02:45.790 --> 02:48.626
Neither does God."

02:51.212 --> 02:55.508
<i>That's the first time I've heard
Shizuka say something like that.</i>

02:56.509 --> 02:58.678
<i>I feel like we've gotten closer.</i>

02:58.761 --> 03:00.555
<i>I'm happy-pi.</i>

03:01.931 --> 03:05.268
<i>Compared to the last time we looked up
at the stars like this, we've gotten even...</i>

03:07.437 --> 03:08.771
<i>Wait?</i>

03:08.855 --> 03:10.273
<i>I think it was</i>

03:11.232 --> 03:13.610
<i>the sixth day since I met Shizuka.</i>

03:13.693 --> 03:15.486
<i>That happens to be today.</i>

03:15.570 --> 03:19.449
<i>And Shizuka died the next day,</i>

03:19.532 --> 03:20.825
<i>which is tomorrow.</i>

03:21.618 --> 03:25.622
<i>Shizuka came to the park
with Chappy's collar.</i>

03:28.249 --> 03:29.292
<i>Huh?</i>

03:30.251 --> 03:33.296
<i>At that time, how come Chappy...</i>

03:35.465 --> 03:37.383
<i>wasn't there-pi?</i>

03:39.219 --> 03:42.722
- Pi!
- Going out at this hour is so shameless.

03:43.473 --> 03:46.392
I guess being slutty runs in the family.

03:49.437 --> 03:50.688
Marina...

03:50.772 --> 03:53.608
Oh, the dirty dog.

03:53.691 --> 03:56.152
- I've been thinking about it for a while.
- Chappy.

03:56.236 --> 04:00.782
Do parasites and whores
have the right to own a dog?

04:00.865 --> 04:02.158
Chappy, come back! Hurry up!

04:02.242 --> 04:05.119
Answer me, I'm asking you!

04:05.787 --> 04:08.331
A parasite who can't live on her own

04:08.414 --> 04:11.125
has no right to own a shitty dog.

04:11.209 --> 04:12.335
<i>Marina.</i>

04:12.418 --> 04:14.671
<i>- Hasn't she become gentler now?</i>
- You can't answer me?

04:15.380 --> 04:16.214
Is it because

04:16.297 --> 04:18.591
- parasites can't talk?
<i>- I'm so scared that I can't move...</i>

04:21.844 --> 04:23.179
Chappy!

04:25.640 --> 04:27.475
No!

04:31.479 --> 04:32.480
It hurts!

04:32.563 --> 04:34.148
Someone help me!

04:34.232 --> 04:35.066
<i>There's a dog!</i>

04:35.149 --> 04:35.984
<i>A scary dog!</i>

04:36.067 --> 04:37.318
<i>It attacked me!</i>

04:37.402 --> 04:38.653
<i>Call the police or the health center!</i>

04:38.736 --> 04:40.280
<i>Catch it quickly!</i>

04:42.615 --> 04:44.409
<i>What's going on-pi?</i>

04:46.244 --> 04:47.620
Chappy.

04:48.621 --> 04:49.455
Wait.

04:51.082 --> 04:52.417
Chappy...

04:52.500 --> 04:53.668
<i>Crying.</i>

04:53.751 --> 04:56.045
<i>Shizuka is crying-pi.</i>

04:56.796 --> 04:59.048
<i>This is absolutely not okay-pi.</i>

04:59.674 --> 05:00.842
<i>I will...</i>

05:01.884 --> 05:05.138
<i>I'll figure something out-pi!</i>

05:09.642 --> 05:10.977
Takopi?

05:11.602 --> 05:13.813
Let's take a different route
for our walk-pi.

05:13.896 --> 05:15.481
What are you talking about?

05:16.524 --> 05:18.651
Is there something on this route?

05:18.735 --> 05:20.862
- No.
<i>- As long as we avoid the park today,</i>

05:20.945 --> 05:23.114
<i>we won't run into Marina, so it's okay.</i>

05:23.197 --> 05:25.742
- Found you.
- Pi!

05:26.326 --> 05:29.203
<i>This is going south-pi!</i>

05:29.829 --> 05:31.664
How about a morning walk instead-pi?

05:34.459 --> 05:36.085
Let's just go for a walk tomorrow-pi.

05:38.629 --> 05:39.881
<i>Huh?</i>

05:39.964 --> 05:41.382
<i>This is weird-pi.</i>

05:42.216 --> 05:43.217
<i>No matter when or where,</i>

05:43.301 --> 05:45.178
<i>no matter how many times I do it over,
Chappy will...</i>

05:46.137 --> 05:47.138
All right.

05:47.221 --> 05:48.806
That went smoothly.

05:48.890 --> 05:50.433
It's all good.

05:50.516 --> 05:52.685
It was worth looking all over for her.

05:52.769 --> 05:54.312
Are you okay?

05:55.396 --> 05:58.066
<i>- Is it because Marina came to find us-pi?</i>
- I didn't do anything. It suddenly bit me.

05:58.149 --> 05:59.067
You can relax now.

06:01.194 --> 06:05.573
<i>But in that case,
it's hard not to run into her-pi.</i>

06:06.616 --> 06:10.078
<i>And why would she purposely
come to get bitten-pi?</i>

06:11.621 --> 06:13.289
<i>It clearly hurts...</i>

06:14.624 --> 06:19.212
<i>I know! I'll ask Shizuka,
who's also human-pi.</i>

06:19.796 --> 06:22.256
<i>I might be able to learn
something about Marina.</i>

06:23.966 --> 06:25.468
Shizuka.

06:25.968 --> 06:28.221
There's something I want to ask you-pi.

06:28.304 --> 06:29.555
Chappy,

06:31.099 --> 06:32.225
wait.

06:32.934 --> 06:34.727
Don't leave me.

06:39.398 --> 06:40.608
<i>Bye-bye.</i>

06:42.485 --> 06:45.113
<i>At this rate, Shizuka will...</i>

06:49.325 --> 06:50.701
Shizuka!

06:54.539 --> 06:55.748
I...

06:56.332 --> 07:00.002
I will definitely... save you-pi.

07:00.670 --> 07:05.633
So you can spend every day
smiling with Chappy.

07:06.551 --> 07:08.344
Even if I can't do it this time,

07:08.427 --> 07:10.012
I'll do it over and over again.

07:10.096 --> 07:12.056
I'll find a way for sure-pi.

07:13.307 --> 07:16.936
So that you don't have
to do something heartbreaking.

07:18.020 --> 07:21.732
So please, believe in me!

07:25.987 --> 07:28.114
Takopi?

07:28.197 --> 07:29.240
This time, for sure...

07:30.116 --> 07:36.622
I'll make you smile your brightest-pi!

07:44.797 --> 07:45.965
So, Shizuka,

07:46.757 --> 07:50.219
Chappy is going to your dad's place.

07:51.179 --> 07:54.724
A dog that bites people
can't live in this town.

07:56.309 --> 07:58.269
So you'll have a chance
to pick it up one day.

08:07.236 --> 08:08.154
Let's go.

08:11.949 --> 08:13.409
In the first place,

08:13.493 --> 08:15.620
he was the one who left that dog behind.

08:15.703 --> 08:16.662
MUNICIPAL HEALTH CENTER

08:16.746 --> 08:17.622
Oh, and...

08:19.040 --> 08:22.793
Marina? I don't think
her injury is serious.

08:22.877 --> 08:25.630
But her mom, Mrs. Kirarazaka,
seems to be very angry.

08:26.631 --> 08:28.466
It's really troublesome.

08:29.133 --> 08:32.386
I'll still go and apologize
for that person's sake.

08:34.639 --> 08:37.391
Please don't cause
unnecessary trouble for me.

08:40.853 --> 08:42.480
I'll get back to work then.

08:43.147 --> 08:45.358
Just eat whatever for dinner.

08:45.441 --> 08:46.984
I'll be home before dawn.

08:48.528 --> 08:49.820
By the way, Shizuka.

08:50.947 --> 08:53.658
Why do you have
a chameleon plant in your hair?

08:55.952 --> 08:57.828
<i>After that, no matter
how many times I tried,</i>

08:59.247 --> 09:02.542
<i>Chappy would always be taken away-pi.</i>

09:03.417 --> 09:06.462
<i>But I will never give up-pi.</i>

09:07.380 --> 09:08.256
<i>Because...</i>

09:08.756 --> 09:11.592
<i>Shizuka is still alive.</i>

09:12.593 --> 09:14.178
<i>So I'll do my best</i>

09:14.262 --> 09:17.682
<i>to bring Chappy back
from "Papa's place"-pi.</i>

09:18.724 --> 09:20.935
Shizuka, don't worry.

09:21.018 --> 09:24.063
I'll definitely bring Chappy back-pi.

09:24.564 --> 09:26.774
So please cheer up-pi.

09:29.318 --> 09:32.363
Where's "Papa's place," pi?

09:33.197 --> 09:35.491
I'll go check now-pi.

09:37.535 --> 09:38.828
Shizuka.

09:39.453 --> 09:41.581
Aren't you hungry-pi?

09:41.664 --> 09:44.083
Here, it's bread from school lunch-pi.

09:44.166 --> 09:45.710
Eat up-pi.

09:53.884 --> 09:56.679
<i>How can I make her smile-pi?</i>

10:00.683 --> 10:01.517
<i>That's it!</i>

10:02.101 --> 10:04.228
<i>If she sees everyone at school...</i>

10:05.104 --> 10:06.314
She's here.

10:06.397 --> 10:08.024
I can't believe she's here.

10:08.107 --> 10:09.191
Did you guys hear?

10:09.275 --> 10:11.152
- Marina was...
- Yeah, I heard!

10:11.235 --> 10:12.737
- She was seriously injured.
- She told the dog to bite her, didn't she?

10:12.820 --> 10:14.030
She had the nerve to show up at school?

10:14.113 --> 10:16.657
DIE!

10:25.416 --> 10:29.378
Well, if it isn't the girl who let
her shitty dog loose and hurt someone.

10:29.462 --> 10:31.172
Good morning.

10:32.465 --> 10:34.133
How dare you come here?

10:35.051 --> 10:36.510
Pi...

10:37.720 --> 10:39.680
That's all for today.

10:39.764 --> 10:42.433
We're changing rooms
for the next class. Don't be late.

10:43.559 --> 10:46.395
My hand bled so much.

10:46.479 --> 10:47.730
You're so mean.

10:47.813 --> 10:48.898
You owe her compensation.

10:49.982 --> 10:53.152
I could have gotten rabies!

10:53.903 --> 10:54.904
Pi!

10:55.613 --> 10:57.114
Apologize.

10:58.199 --> 10:59.825
Hey.

11:00.576 --> 11:01.952
Kirarazaka.

11:02.578 --> 11:04.872
The next class is in the music room.

11:04.955 --> 11:06.457
It's time to go.

11:09.126 --> 11:10.378
Let's go.

11:10.461 --> 11:12.713
What should I bring to music class?

11:12.797 --> 11:14.298
Recorder and...

11:15.299 --> 11:17.551
Kuze, are you all right?

11:18.135 --> 11:20.971
If you're not feeling well,
go to the nurse's office.

11:21.055 --> 11:22.765
If there's anything I can do to help,

11:23.349 --> 11:24.725
just let me...

11:32.525 --> 11:35.736
Hey, no matter what I do to her,
she doesn't react. It's so creepy.

11:36.404 --> 11:37.822
It's so boring.

11:37.905 --> 11:39.615
What should we do tomorrow?

11:43.077 --> 11:44.870
I'm sorry, everyone.

11:44.954 --> 11:47.248
Can you guys go home first today?

11:47.331 --> 11:48.791
Do you have plans?

11:48.874 --> 11:52.086
I see. See you tomorrow.

12:07.059 --> 12:08.269
Shizuka.

12:17.069 --> 12:20.448
<i>Shizuka hasn't regained
her spirits at all-pi.</i>

12:23.033 --> 12:24.201
<i>Could it be...</i>

12:24.285 --> 12:26.328
Are you hungry-pi?

12:26.412 --> 12:28.456
Because you didn't eat your school lunch.

12:29.039 --> 12:30.040
Parasite.

12:30.916 --> 12:32.168
<i>Marina!</i>

12:32.751 --> 12:36.172
I want to talk to you. Come with me.

12:41.552 --> 12:44.388
Don't ignore me, skank.

12:48.726 --> 12:54.273
Let's talk about your cute Chappy.

12:55.941 --> 12:57.526
Okay.

12:58.110 --> 13:00.529
<i>- Shizuka spoke-pi.</i>
- Let's go then.

13:00.613 --> 13:03.324
<i>Now she can finally cheer up
and "talk" to Marina.</i>

13:05.493 --> 13:07.745
<i>No, that's not it-pi.</i>

13:07.828 --> 13:10.664
<i>This might be a good chance-pi.</i>

13:10.748 --> 13:13.792
<i>They might make up this time.</i>

13:15.461 --> 13:17.963
<i>If that's the case,
I can't keep running away.</i>

13:18.506 --> 13:20.549
<i>Even if I'm scared, I have to face it.</i>

13:22.009 --> 13:25.971
I have to help them make up-pi.

13:26.472 --> 13:29.266
Wait for me-pi!

13:32.811 --> 13:33.854
NO TRESPASSING

13:33.938 --> 13:35.147
Pi!

13:40.778 --> 13:43.239
<i>Can't you come home earlier?</i>

13:43.322 --> 13:45.199
<i>Why are you bringing that up again?</i>

13:45.282 --> 13:47.701
- Mari is lonely too.
- I'm working my butt off out there!

13:49.662 --> 13:50.788
Mari.

13:52.706 --> 13:55.292
Mari, you understand, right?

13:56.418 --> 13:58.796
You're the only one

14:01.507 --> 14:03.092
<i>who's always on Mama's side.</i>

14:11.642 --> 14:13.519
Cha... Chappy--

14:21.986 --> 14:24.738
The dog's dead. What about it?

14:27.408 --> 14:28.576
He's not dead.

14:28.659 --> 14:29.702
It's dead.

14:32.371 --> 14:34.164
- He's not dead.
- It is.

14:34.248 --> 14:35.708
It's dead.

14:35.791 --> 14:37.501
- He went to my dad's place.
- It's very dead.

14:37.585 --> 14:38.836
It's dead.

14:38.919 --> 14:41.171
He can come back anytime.

14:41.255 --> 14:42.339
Look, his collar is...

14:44.842 --> 14:47.428
It bit a kid's hand
and got sent to the health center.

14:48.095 --> 14:51.015
Of course it'd be dead, idiot!

14:51.807 --> 14:55.561
You don't have a papa or a kind mama!

14:55.644 --> 14:59.231
You don't have friends,
and no one worries about you!

14:59.315 --> 15:02.192
Even the only gutter dog
that was like you is dead now!

15:05.487 --> 15:06.447
Hey.

15:07.740 --> 15:09.325
You should die too.

15:11.452 --> 15:12.870
<i>I'm scared-pi.</i>

15:12.953 --> 15:14.747
<i>So... so scary-pi.</i>

15:15.664 --> 15:17.499
<i>- She's too scary-pi.</i>
- You're a parasite who only causes trouble

15:17.583 --> 15:19.335
<i>- So scary that I can't even move a single...</i>
- by being alive.

15:19.418 --> 15:20.252
Pi!

15:21.420 --> 15:24.590
Do you know where you get
your living expenses from?

15:25.591 --> 15:27.760
From my papa's wallet.

15:27.843 --> 15:30.971
The clothes you wear and the food you eat

15:31.055 --> 15:32.598
are all bought with the money

15:32.681 --> 15:35.726
- that your mom squeezes from men!
- Chappy.

15:36.435 --> 15:40.022
The money my papa worked so hard for!

15:40.105 --> 15:42.483
- Chappy.
- If only you hadn't existed!

15:49.907 --> 15:54.787
Papa would've bought that ring for Mama.

15:56.372 --> 15:59.500
Instead of being with
some escort he barely knows,

16:00.084 --> 16:01.669
he would've stayed with his family.

16:05.839 --> 16:08.926
<i>Th-This is bad-pi!</i>

16:09.677 --> 16:12.972
Shizuka seems to be hurting a lot-pi!

16:13.055 --> 16:15.182
I have to save her quickly.

16:15.265 --> 16:16.308
Oh, right-pi.

16:16.392 --> 16:17.810
If I use the Happy Camera,

16:17.893 --> 16:18.852
I can start over--

16:18.936 --> 16:20.187
- Shut up!
- Pi!

16:20.270 --> 16:21.897
If only you weren't here,

16:21.981 --> 16:24.149
Mama would go back to the way she was!

16:24.233 --> 16:25.359
<i>Chappy.</i>

16:27.194 --> 16:30.364
As long as I have Chappy, I'll be fine.

16:31.115 --> 16:33.367
I don't need anything else.

16:33.993 --> 16:36.328
I'll be okay no matter what happens,

16:37.162 --> 16:41.291
no matter how much it hurts
or how hard it is.

16:42.751 --> 16:43.836
<i>Shizuka.</i>

16:45.045 --> 16:46.714
<i>At this rate...</i>

16:46.797 --> 16:48.799
<i>if I just hide and watch,</i>

16:49.550 --> 16:51.510
<i>that will happen again-pi.</i>

16:52.678 --> 16:59.351
<i>Shizuka.</i>

16:59.435 --> 17:01.729
Give me back my papa!

17:01.812 --> 17:03.564
<i>I have to be brave.</i>

17:03.647 --> 17:04.898
<i>Shizuka!</i>

17:04.982 --> 17:11.655
<i>I'll really save you this time-pi!</i>

17:41.310 --> 17:44.605
Marina isn't moving at all-pi.

17:45.189 --> 17:46.982
Did it hurt too much-pi?

17:48.650 --> 17:51.862
Marina. Marina.

17:53.614 --> 17:55.574
Something's wrong.

17:56.075 --> 17:58.077
Pain is not a good thing-pi.

17:58.660 --> 18:01.371
Let's start over with the Happy Camera
and talk to her properly.

18:04.583 --> 18:05.834
That's weird-pi?

18:13.592 --> 18:14.760
Is she dead?

18:15.719 --> 18:17.096
Shizuka?

18:18.680 --> 18:21.558
She definitely looks dead.

18:24.144 --> 18:25.813
<i>Dead?</i>

18:25.896 --> 18:27.397
<i>- It's my fault-pi?
- What's that red stuff?</i>

18:27.481 --> 18:28.524
- <i>The Happy Camera</i>
- <i>Marina? She's dead.</i>

18:28.607 --> 18:29.525
- <i>stopped working too-pi.
- Just like Shizuka.</i>

18:29.608 --> 18:30.901
<i>What should I do? It's broken?</i>

18:32.694 --> 18:33.737
Takopi.

18:36.240 --> 18:40.619
Takopi, you're amazing!

18:42.996 --> 18:44.665
Amazing!

18:44.748 --> 18:46.458
You're really amazing.

18:46.542 --> 18:49.920
I don't believe in magic.

18:50.003 --> 18:52.798
But I've been thinking,

18:53.465 --> 18:56.552
"If only Marina weren't here!"

18:56.635 --> 18:58.512
Then I wouldn't hate going to school.

18:59.221 --> 19:01.890
But I couldn't do anything on my own.

19:03.475 --> 19:06.311
I didn't think my wish would come true.

19:06.395 --> 19:08.897
But it did.

19:09.648 --> 19:11.775
It really came true.

19:12.359 --> 19:13.902
That's amazing.

19:14.611 --> 19:16.613
It's just like magic!

19:18.657 --> 19:20.909
Is... Is that so-pi?

19:20.993 --> 19:22.161
Of course it is.

19:22.244 --> 19:24.830
Since magic exists,

19:24.913 --> 19:27.457
Chappy must be alive too.

19:27.958 --> 19:29.793
If I go to my dad,

19:29.877 --> 19:31.670
I'm sure I can see him again!

19:34.423 --> 19:37.384
<i>Is this really...</i>

19:37.467 --> 19:38.677
Takopi!

19:42.055 --> 19:43.891
Thank you, Takopi,

19:45.017 --> 19:46.560
for killing her for me.

19:48.061 --> 19:49.938
<i>"Taking someone's life."</i>

19:50.022 --> 19:52.649
<i>In your language,</i>

19:52.733 --> 19:54.818
<i>I think it's called "killing."</i>

19:56.570 --> 20:00.199
<i>Shizuka smiled at me.</i>

20:01.783 --> 20:04.369
Let's go, then.

20:05.495 --> 20:09.708
<i>On the third planet
in the solar system, "Earth,"</i>

20:10.459 --> 20:13.378
<i>it's been seven days
since I landed here from Happy Planet.</i>

20:15.547 --> 20:17.049
<i>I can't start over.</i>

20:17.674 --> 20:20.677
